"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"FAUNA:1\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">1</span> 標題：動物概述</h1><nav class=\"thlex-index\"><ul>\n<li><a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"UBSFaunaLexicon\" data-key=\"FAUNA:1.1\" href=\"#FAUNA:1.1\">1.1 家畜、牛、牲畜、動物、活的物</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"UBSFaunaLexicon\" data-key=\"FAUNA:1.2\" href=\"#FAUNA:1.2\">1.2 騎乘動物或馱重動物</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"UBSFaunaLexicon\" data-key=\"FAUNA:1.3\" href=\"#FAUNA:1.3\">1.3 野生動物或危險動物</a></li>\n</ul></nav><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>聖經中有一些泛指「動物」的詞語，並沒有指定具體的物種。幾乎所有語言都有一個或多個詞語表示「活的」或「有呼吸的」或「有靈魂的」（英文單詞&quot;animal&quot;的字面含義）動物。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來：בְּהֵמָה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：behemah)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01007002\" data-end-ref=\"01007002\">GEN 7:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01007002\" data-end-ref=\"01007002\">GEN 7:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01007008\" data-end-ref=\"01007008\">GEN 7:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01007008\" data-end-ref=\"01007008\">GEN 7:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011002\" data-end-ref=\"03011002\">LEV 11:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011003\" data-end-ref=\"03011003\">LEV 11:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011026\" data-end-ref=\"03011026\">LEV 11:26</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011039\" data-end-ref=\"03011039\">LEV 11:39</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011046\" data-end-ref=\"03011046\">LEV 11:46</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03018023\" data-end-ref=\"03018023\">LEV 18:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03018023\" data-end-ref=\"03018023\">LEV 18:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03020015\" data-end-ref=\"03020015\">LEV 20:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03020015\" data-end-ref=\"03020015\">LEV 20:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03020016\" data-end-ref=\"03020016\">LEV 20:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03020016\" data-end-ref=\"03020016\">LEV 20:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03020025\" data-end-ref=\"03020025\">LEV 20:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03020025\" data-end-ref=\"03020025\">LEV 20:25</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來：חַי, חַיָּה, חֵיוָה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：chay, chayah, cheva)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001028\" data-end-ref=\"01001028\">GEN 1:28</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01001030\" data-end-ref=\"01001030\">GEN 1:30</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01006019\" data-end-ref=\"01006019\">GEN 6:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01008017\" data-end-ref=\"01008017\">GEN 8:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011047\" data-end-ref=\"03011047\">LEV 11:47</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03011047\" data-end-ref=\"03011047\">LEV 11:47</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19104025\" data-end-ref=\"19104025\">PSA 104:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002038\" data-end-ref=\"27002038\">DAN 2:38</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004009\" data-end-ref=\"27004009\">DAN 4:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004011\" data-end-ref=\"27004011\">DAN 4:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004012\" data-end-ref=\"27004012\">DAN 4:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004013\" data-end-ref=\"27004013\">DAN 4:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004018\" data-end-ref=\"27004018\">DAN 4:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004020\" data-end-ref=\"27004020\">DAN 4:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004022\" data-end-ref=\"27004022\">DAN 4:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27004029\" data-end-ref=\"27004029\">DAN 4:29</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27005021\" data-end-ref=\"27005021\">DAN 5:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007003\" data-end-ref=\"27007003\">DAN 7:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007005\" data-end-ref=\"27007005\">DAN 7:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007006\" data-end-ref=\"27007006\">DAN 7:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007007\" data-end-ref=\"27007007\">DAN 7:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007007\" data-end-ref=\"27007007\">DAN 7:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007011\" data-end-ref=\"27007011\">DAN 7:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007012\" data-end-ref=\"27007012\">DAN 7:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007017\" data-end-ref=\"27007017\">DAN 7:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007019\" data-end-ref=\"27007019\">DAN 7:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007023\" data-end-ref=\"27007023\">DAN 7:23</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：θήρ, θήρα</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：thēr)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">WIS 11:18, 2MA 4:25, 2MA 11:9, 3MA 5:31, 3MA 6:7</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：ζῷον</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：zōon)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58013011\" data-end-ref=\"58013011\">HEB 13:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61002012\" data-end-ref=\"61002012\">2PE 2:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"65001010\" data-end-ref=\"65001010\">JUD 1:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004006\" data-end-ref=\"66004006\">REV 4:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004007\" data-end-ref=\"66004007\">REV 4:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004007\" data-end-ref=\"66004007\">REV 4:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004007\" data-end-ref=\"66004007\">REV 4:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004007\" data-end-ref=\"66004007\">REV 4:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004008\" data-end-ref=\"66004008\">REV 4:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004009\" data-end-ref=\"66004009\">REV 4:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66005006\" data-end-ref=\"66005006\">REV 5:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66005008\" data-end-ref=\"66005008\">REV 5:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66005011\" data-end-ref=\"66005011\">REV 5:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66005014\" data-end-ref=\"66005014\">REV 5:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006001\" data-end-ref=\"66006001\">REV 6:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006003\" data-end-ref=\"66006003\">REV 6:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006005\" data-end-ref=\"66006005\">REV 6:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006006\" data-end-ref=\"66006006\">REV 6:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006007\" data-end-ref=\"66006007\">REV 6:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66007011\" data-end-ref=\"66007011\">REV 7:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66014003\" data-end-ref=\"66014003\">REV 14:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66015007\" data-end-ref=\"66015007\">REV 15:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66019004\" data-end-ref=\"66019004\">REV 19:4</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：κνώδαλον</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：knōdalon)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">WIS 11:15, WIS 16:1, WIS 17:9</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：κτῆνος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：ktēnos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">1ES 2:7, 1ES 2:9, 1ES 5:1, 1ES 8:50, 1ES 9:4, TOB 10:11, JDT 4:10, JDT 5:9, JDT 8:7, JDT 11:7, JDT 11:12, SIR 7:22, SIR 40:8, BAR 3:32, 1MA 1:47, 1MA 2:30, 1MA 2:38, 1MA 12:23</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：τετράποδος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：tetrapodos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">BAR 3:32</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：χερσαῖος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯：chersaios)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">WIS 19:19</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉：anima, animalis</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 6:47, 2ES 6:48, 2ES 11:39, 2ES 11:40</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉：bestia</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 5:8, 2ES 6:53, 2ES 7:65, 2ES 8:30</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉：creatura</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 5:45, 2ES 11:6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉：quadrupes</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 7:65</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">討論</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>希伯來文<em>behemah</em> 具有多種含義，包含本章提到的所有動物類別：一般的動物、馴養動物、騎乘動物和野生動物。這個詞在聖經中共出現了大約190次。在每個動物類別中，都為其列出了幾個有代表性的參考經文。大多時候，上下文能夠顯示哪個含義是恰當的。</p>\n<p>希伯來文<em>chay</em> 、<em>chayah</em> 和<em>cheva</em> ，以及希臘文<em>zōon</em> ，都源自一個意為「生命」、「活著」的詞根。這些詞可以指任何類型的生物，有時指人類，有時指動物或者生活在水中的動物，還有些時候指所有生物。然而，這些詞都是指某種形式的動物，而不是指植物。<em>Chay</em> 在有些經文中用作形容詞，例如「有生命的」或「活著的」。雖然<em>chay</em> 不特指哪種動物，但通常可以從上下文中知道所指的是什麽。然而，在《創世記》、《以西結書》和《啟示錄》的一些參考經文中，我們不知道文中指的是哪種動物，只知道牠們是活的。<em>Tetrapodos</em> 和<em>quadrupes</em> 的字面意思是「四足的」，指一般意義上的動物，特別指哺乳動物，與蛇類、鳥類和其他生物相對。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">特殊意義或象徵意義</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>在《創世記》、《以西結書》和《啟示錄》中，「活物」顯然與賜予生命的上帝有某種聯繫。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻譯</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>在大多數語言中，「活的物」這個統稱必須根據上下文翻譯成不同的詞語。當上下文明顯指人時，意指「活人」的表述就是恰當的譯詞；而在其他語境中，「活的動物」、「活的生物」等短語可能是最佳的對等表述。在有些情況下，採用「動物」的統稱比較恰當，比如「這些人不比無理性的動物更好……」（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Contemporary English Version\">CEV</abbr> 直譯）。在有關祭物的經文中，根據具體的上下文，最好將其譯成「活鴿子」、「活山羊」或其他活的祭牲。</p>\n<p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66004006\" data-end-ref=\"66004006\">REV 4:6</data> ：這裡譯為「活物」的詞在大多數情況下是指「動物」，但這裡不應該採用這個詞語。他們只是活的存在物，似乎是以<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26001005\" data-end-ref=\"26001014\">EZK 1:5–EZK 1:14</data> 中的活物為原型，並沒有指明是動物還是人類。在許多具有悠久基督信仰傳統的地方，如果使用「基路伯」或「撒拉弗」的音譯來翻譯「活物」（如果翻譯者認為這個術語應該繼續使用），就應該提供一個腳註或者在術語簡釋中增加一個條目，來描述這些受造物。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
